---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Cookie Policy | Charnwood Intimacy"
  description="How Charnwood Intimacy uses cookies and similar technologies on this website."
  path="/cookie-policy/"
>
  <section class="section section--white">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">
        Last updated 20 July 2026. This site is built to keep cookies to a minimum. If Jo adds
        analytics, booking, or advertising tools in future, this page should be updated to list
        them, in the same way Charnwood Counselling's cookie policy lists its own.
      </p>

      <p>
        This Cookie Policy explains how Charnwood Intimacy ("we", "us", "our") uses cookies and
        similar technologies on this website (charnwoodintimacy.co.uk).
      </p>

      <h2>What are cookies?</h2>
      <p>
        Cookies are small data files placed on your device when you visit a website. They're used
        to make websites work, work more efficiently, or to provide reporting information to the
        site owner.
      </p>

      <h2>What cookies does this site use?</h2>
      <p>
        This website is built as a simple, static site with no advertising or tracking cookies.
        The contact and booking forms are processed on our own server and delivered to us by
        email through Brevo, our email provider. That process does not set tracking cookies in
        your browser.
      </p>
      <h3>Cloudflare Turnstile</h3>
      <p>
        Our forms are protected by Cloudflare Turnstile, which checks that a form is being
        submitted by a person rather than an automated bot. This is a security measure that
        protects the forms from spam and misuse, and it may store information in your browser
        for that purpose. It does not track you across other websites and is not used for
        advertising or analytics. You can read more in
        {' '}<a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/turnstile-privacy-policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cloudflare's Turnstile privacy policy</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        If Jo later adds tools such as website analytics (for example Google Analytics), a live
        booking calendar, or embedded video, those tools may set their own cookies. This page will
        be updated to describe them, along with how to opt out, at that point.
      </p>

      <h2>How can I control cookies?</h2>
      <p>
        You can control and delete cookies through your browser settings at any time. Blocking all
        cookies may affect the functionality of some websites, though this site is designed to
        work without relying on non-essential cookies.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Chrome</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/enhanced-tracking-protection-firefox-desktop" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Firefox</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://support.apple.com/en-ie/guide/safari/sfri11471/mac" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Safari</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/microsoft-edge-browsing-data-and-privacy-bb8174ba-9d73-dcf2-9b4a-c582b4e640dd" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Edge</a></li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about this Cookie Policy, please contact us via our{' '}
        <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose > * {
    max-width: 800px;
  }
  .prose p, .prose li {
    color: var(--text-soft);
  }
  .prose ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5em;
  }
  .updated {
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--coral);
    padding-left: 16px;
  }
</style>
